{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2022-07-21 06:30:00', 'title': "COGNIZANT TEAMS UP WITH ORGANON TO SPEED DELIVERY OF PHARMACEUTICAL PRODUCTS AND IMPROVE WOMEN'S HEALTHCARE", 'text': "ORGANON'S MANUFACTURING SITE EFFICIENCIES EXPECTED TO IMPROVE SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT AND SPEED HEALTHCARE PRODUCT DELIVERY TEANACK, N.J., JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COGNIZANT (NASDAQ: CTSH) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A NEW MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT WITH ORGANON (NYSE: OGN), A GLOBAL WOMEN'S HEALTH COMPANY, TO HELP IMPROVE THE COMPANY'S DELIVERY OF HEALTHCARE PRODUCTS AND CRUCIAL MEDICINAL SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT."}